make sure you go show moko j some love  the links will be in the description  below so just some final thoughts i've  had a couple of townscapers ask me if i  had any advice as far as building is  concerned the only advice that i have  for you guys is to take your time and  use your imagination townscaper in my  personal opinion is art it's a digital  canvas that allows you to create  beautiful towns no two towns will ever  be the same and everyone's style is  different you have to play with the grid  and just see what's out there as far as  combos don't be afraid to remove blocks  here and there uh because you never know  what you're gonna get and if you don't  like the way it looks you can just  change it back play with the colors and  you'll notice how connecting blocks may  or may not change just messing around  with the grid in different colors will  give you a new perspective on aesthetics  just experiment with it and get crazy  and just you know just let your  imagination soar you'd be surprised what  you can do with townscaper seriously i  see some really really cool stuff on  discord by the way if you're not in the  discord you should definitely join it  i'm going to put the links back in the  description so if you want to join the  discord and you want to meet like-minded  people who also enjoy townscaper that is  the place for you to be that concludes  this tutorial you have officially  graduated from townscape university and  you can move your tassels to the right  of your cap to signify your rite of  passage in townscape or academia i hope  you guys enjoyed this video please make  sure that you check out the links in the  description below there are some really  amazing people that i talked about moko  j you gotta go check out township you  gotta go check out joaquis  and and go check out his twitch go check  that out just go just go do it you guys  join the discord just go do it i hope  you guys enjoyed this video thank you  all for your support as always it's  greatly appreciated i really really  appreciate it from the bottom of my  heart i hope you guys stick around for  more and i hope you guys continue to  enjoy my content and i will see you all  next time  you
 

